;Insert the first usable opening as soon as the engine reports a replaceable
;span, a second at 40 percent, and a third after three quarters. A perimeter
;which runs into water may never report 75 percent complete, so circulation
;cannot depend on that late milestone alone. The owner count is
;perimeter-specific; a scenario or unrelated gate elsewhere must not suppress
;these requests. Gate timing is independent of the wall command/backoff
